      "caption": "",
      "index": 0,
      "text": "Option A: Participate live during each live Zoom lecture. Join a live Zoom lecture. Use Poll Everywhere during the lecture. Note: You can get credit for participation once for each assignment. If you do the assignment in Poll Everywhere, you do not need to do the asynchronous assignment. A zero will appear in the Canvas grade book if you do not complete the Poll Everywhere assignment. It will be deleted when your asynchronous assignment is graded. Option B: Participate asynchronously by watching the recorded Lecture Videos (posted at the bottom of the Learning Materials page for the module). After a video is posted, you can access the corresponding asynchronous participation assignment here: M5-1asy M5-2asy M5-3asy M5-4asy M5-5asy M5-6asy M5-7asy Feel free to switch back and forth between live participation and asynchronous participation as your schedule allows."
    },
    {
      "caption": "",
      "index": 1,
      "text": "Option 1: Take the quiz asynchronously. Quiz 3A_asy (Remotely Proctored) Quiz 3A_asy_work Quiz 3B_asy (Remotely Proctored) Quiz 3B_asy_work Option 2: Join a live Zoom session and take the quiz then. Quiz 3A Quiz 3A_6pm Quiz 3B Quiz 3B_6pm"
    }
